{"2615150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hyper Tanks", "steam_appid": 2615150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hyper Tanks</strong> is an arcade-style arena shooter where shots bounce off walls! Choose from a variety of tank classes, conquer challenging <strong>solo &amp; co-op campaigns</strong> and battle your friends or bots in chaotic <strong>multiplayer modes</strong>! Dodge incoming fire, collect powerups and deploy special weapons to survive this action-packed mayhem! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615150/extras/7e5be8ecd35ee5755dac102095d55053.poster.avif?t=1786461840\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615150/extras/7e5be8ecd35ee5755dac102095d55053.webm?t=1786461840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615150/extras/7e5be8ecd35ee5755dac102095d55053.mp4?t=1786461840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615150/extras/a1379cdb537dd052d3e60c9b64fb5023.avif?t=1786461840\" width=1170 height=85 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy hordes of enemies in epic <strong>campaigns</strong>, either <strong>solo </strong>or in <strong>co-op</strong>! If you lose all your lives, your run starts over!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The lore:</strong> A rogue AI has compromised the world’s Hyper Grid. As a corporate Hyper Pilot equipped with a state-of-the-art Hyper Tank, you must reclaim the Grid and destroy the machine boss and its subordinates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Predictable variety:</strong> Each campaign features handcrafted levels in a fixed order to help you  master the challenge, but level layouts and enemy spawns may vary between runs to keep you on your toes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization:</strong> Choose a tank with distinct traits and abilities and select its upgrades from randomized rewards throughout the run. The further you progress, the more playable tanks you unlock.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactics:</strong> Use clever tactics to overcome the enemy forces' numerical advantage. Ambush unsuspecting foes from behind, bounce your shots around corners, or turn the tide with powerups and special weapons!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss battles:</strong> All campaigns end with an epic boss fight that will test your skills. Beat each one to save the Grid!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615150/extras/fd5194ae87b64199c1f894dcd60727b2.poster.avif?t=1786461840\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615150/extras/fd5194ae87b64199c1f894dcd60727b2.webm?t=1786461840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615150/extras/fd5194ae87b64199c1f894dcd60727b2.mp4?t=1786461840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615150/extras/a9f17bbf43f1ab563f0bc6c7f0efee43.avif?t=1786461840\" width=1170 height=85 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle your friends or bots in action-packed <strong>multiplayer modes</strong> for up to 4 players! </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Many modes</strong>: Play various Skirmish modes with unique rules and objectives, including classics like <i>Deathmatch</i> or <i>Capture the Flag</i>! Some modes can be played either as a free-for-all or as a team battle. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arena atmosphere</strong>: A classic announcer calls out key highlights during the match. Score a Multi-Frag and bask in the glory!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online &amp; offline</strong>: Battle your friends in local couch multiplayer, or invite your Steam friends to join you online via <i>Steam Remote Play Together</i>! They don't even need to own the game to join the fun. <i>[additional players require a controller to play]</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CPU players</strong>: All modes can be played with or against capable Bots. You can control their difficulty  and even give basic commands to your CPU allies!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615150/extras/470c5da8da3708ac331cefc9d54b45de.poster.avif?t=1786461840\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615150/extras/470c5da8da3708ac331cefc9d54b45de.webm?t=1786461840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615150/extras/470c5da8da3708ac331cefc9d54b45de.mp4?t=1786461840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615150/extras/2742568cc9f1983788f49c9aab8e1628.avif?t=1786461840\" width=1170 height=85 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between two <strong>camera perspectives</strong> at the press of a button:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Top-down</strong>: Maintain a clear overview of the battlefield with the tactical top-down perspective. The camera dynamically adjusts its  position based on nearby threats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Third-person</strong>: Immerse yourself in the action with the close-up third-person perspective.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full control</strong>: Switch between the two perspectives at any time during a match. Whether you use keyboard and mouse or a controller, the intuitive controls automatically adapt to your current perspective.<br><i>[matches with multiple human players can only be played from the top-down perspective]</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615150/extras/53906a1a4e7ebb4bdf93bcabc8dcc170.poster.avif?t=1786461840\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615150/extras/53906a1a4e7ebb4bdf93bcabc8dcc170.webm?t=1786461840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615150/extras/53906a1a4e7ebb4bdf93bcabc8dcc170.mp4?t=1786461840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615150/extras/b4954a35cadce7990954f09135d57203.avif?t=1786461840\" width=1170 height=85 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go in guns blazing or take a more tactical approach with the help of <strong>powerful combat effects</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Powerups</strong>: Collect the spawning powerups to enter a temporary Hyper State and gain effects such as increased damage, greater speed, or even stealth!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special weapons:</strong> Choose from a wide range of impactful special weapons, including homing rockets, defense turrets, fireballs, EMPs, tornados, and many more. Oh and of course there is a grappling hook - because every great game needs one.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615150/extras/f17ecfc29a8a88129355ceaaccb3a3d4.poster.avif?t=1786461840\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615150/extras/f17ecfc29a8a88129355ceaaccb3a3d4.webm?t=1786461840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615150/extras/f17ecfc29a8a88129355ceaaccb3a3d4.mp4?t=1786461840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615150/extras/a9e0282a2dda2eddf573ee12b5d04937.avif?t=1786461840\" width=1170 height=85 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick the <strong>Hyper Tank</strong> that suits your playstyle or master all 8 playable classes!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Distinct traits:</strong> Hyper Tanks are state-of-the-art virtual weapons platforms, developed by the world's leading corporations for Hyper Grid warfare. Each tank class feels different thanks to its unique stats, traits, movement methods and weaponry.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tank abilities:</strong> Each tank has class-specific abilities, such as a charged shot, a defense drone or a short-range teleport. Use them at crucial moments to surprise your foes!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">See you on the Grid, Hyper Pilot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615150/extras/2addaf7adb83a0459f4c0ab25970a49c.avif?t=1786461840\" width=1170 height=85 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hyper Tanks</strong> is an arcade-style arena shooter where shots bounce off walls! Choose from a variety of tank classes, conquer challenging <strong>solo &amp; co-op campaigns</strong> and battle your friends or bots in chaotic <strong>multiplayer modes</strong>! Dodge incoming fire, collect powerups and deploy special weapons to survive this action-packed mayhem! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615150/extras/7e5be8ecd35ee5755dac102095d55053.poster.avif?t=1786461840\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615150/extras/7e5be8ecd35ee5755dac102095d55053.webm?t=1786461840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615150/extras/7e5be8ecd35ee5755dac102095d55053.mp4?t=1786461840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615150/extras/a1379cdb537dd052d3e60c9b64fb5023.avif?t=1786461840\" width=1170 height=85 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_pa