er all 8 playable classes!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Distinct traits:</strong> Hyper Tanks are state-of-the-art virtual weapons platforms, developed by the world's leading corporations for Hyper Grid warfare. Each tank class feels different thanks to its unique stats, traits, movement methods and weaponry.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tank abilities:</strong> Each tank has class-specific abilities, such as a charged shot, a defense drone or a short-range teleport. Use them at crucial moments to surprise your foes!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">See you on the Grid, Hyper Pilot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615150/extras/2addaf7adb83a0459f4c0ab25970a49c.avif?t=1786461840\" width=1170 height=85 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Choose your tank and fight in neon-lit arenas where shots ricochet off walls! Beat challenging campaigns solo or in co-op, or battle your friends and bots in action-packed multiplayer modes. Use powerups, special weapons and tank abilities to survive the mayhem of Hyper Tanks!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Spanish - Latin America, Turkish, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Japanese, Ukrainian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615150/0f5127046b042c2fd4baa69d85f699b87a0d128a/header.jpg?t=1786461840", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615150/ef7c826b7b636b4649c03143d9c0b0331c7b5a3e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786461840", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c